Watch[ing] or playing sports. I'm a Milwaukee boy and have maintained an[ avid] following of the Wisconsin sports teams. I love to play rac[quet]ball and have come to[ appreciate] working out as something important for my physical and mental health. And whatever time Leah and I can have with our three married daughters and their families is special time[ indeed].
