Christian is correct. It is stored in a[ mysql] database. X[tr]abackup (Percona.com) for live incremental backups or my[sq]ldump to backup just the email. By default[ mysql] is setup for one big file instead of table per file.
Use the ssh connection method with your regular user name.
[password] is stored in /var/lib/zentyal/conf/sa-mysql.passwd.
